# Lesson 8 — lists
#
# A list holds many things in order. Square brackets hold a list.

my friends are ["Ana", "Bea", "Caio"]

show my friends
say "I have ", how many my friends, " friends"

add "Diogo" to my friends
say "now I have ", how many my friends

take "Bea" from my friends
say "after Bea moves away:"
show my friends
